  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democratic Partnership for a Framework Climate Change Bill for Jamaica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFD provide technical and legal support to the Climate Change Branch of the Government of Jamaica (GoJ) to develop a Concept Note and Drafting Instructions to enable the Parliament of Jamaica to adopt a Framework Climate Change Act, providing a legal underpinning to the Government of Jamaica&#x2019;s range of commitments and objectives on climate action already set out at policy level.</narrative>
  </description>
